   "locked": false,
   "text": "MEMORY (as of 2023-06-30, 42 prior trials visible, snapshot 3f9a1c)\nEvidence is out-of-sample unless marked [IS]; in-sample Sharpe is deflated\nfor 17 distinct configs tried in scope.\nWORKED OR PROMISING IN SIMILAR REGIMES\n  - [b:a1b2c3] works | momentum {fast:20,slow:50} on SPY | OOS Sharpe 0.62 (n_oos=2), n=3, sim=0.91\nAVOID (failed or decayed out-of-sample)\n  - [b:d4e5f6] decays: IS 1.40 -> OOS 0.05 | momentum {fast:5,slow:20} on SPY | ...\nUNTESTED NEARBY (no trials in similar regimes)\n  - momentum {fast:30,slow:100}\nNOTES\n  - [n:9c0d1e] (consolidation) promising -> decays after dream replay",
   "originalText": "MEMORY (as of 2023-06-30, 42 prior trials visible, snapshot 3f9a1c)\nEvidence is out-of-sample unless marked [IS]; in-sample Sharpe is deflated\nfor 17 distinct configs tried in scope.\nWORKED OR PROMISING IN SIMILAR REGIMES\n  - [b:a1b2c3] works | momentum {fast:20,slow:50} on SPY | OOS Sharpe 0.62 (n_oos=2), n=3, sim=0.91\nAVOID (failed or decayed out-of-sample)\n  - [b:d4e5f6] decays: IS 1.40 -> OOS 0.05 | momentum {fast:5,slow:20} on SPY | ...\nUNTESTED NEARBY (no trials in similar regimes)\n  - momentum {fast:30,slow:100}\nNOTES\n  - [n:9c0d1e] (consolidation) promising -> decays after dream replay",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
